92
00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.470
"This is so handy."

93
00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.430
You're right!

94
00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.280
If he'd only found

95
00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.752
